# C28 remediation after attempt-03 (9/8/9/7/8, fail)

| Finding | Remediation | Where |
|---|---|---|
| R1 ⌘T over the palette left focus on the trigger (switcher focused while the rail was still inert) | The switcher focuses its first tenant only once no modal is open (`useModalsOpen`), re-running when the palette has gone, with a next-tick retry; the modal's opener restore yields when something else holds focus. Regression test stubs WebKit's inert refusal (focus inside an `inert` ancestor is a no-op) and asserts the final focus in the list; native N03 exercises the transition | `v2/tenant-switcher.tsx`, `v2/modal.tsx`, `v2-shell.test.tsx`, `acceptance_c28.py` |
| R2 Settings "Use the new interface" discarded the dispatch outcome | The toggle reports refusals in a status line, keeps an unknown delivery visibly unconfirmed with Retry/Dismiss, never re-sends on its own; the observed `uiVariant` stays authoritative; tests in both shells | `shell/feature-view.tsx`, `desktop-shell.test.tsx`, `v2-shell.test.tsx` |
